     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Applying for a job",
     "texto": [
      "Start with **Jeg søger stillingen som …** = I'm applying for the position of…",
      "Finish with **Vedlagt finder du mit CV.** = Attached you'll find my CV. «Vedlagt» means «attached», and it's used at the beginning of the sentence."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Recommending",
     "texto": [
      "To recommend a person, use **Jeg kan varmt anbefale …** = I can warmly recommend…",
      "Then explain why: **Hun er meget flink og arbejder hårdt.** = She is very friendly and works hard."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
